---
import { services } from '../data/services';
import { featuredServiceSlugs } from '../data/serviceGroups';

const featured = services.filter(({ slug }) => featuredServiceSlugs.includes(slug as typeof featuredServiceSlugs[number]));
---

<section id="services" class="bg-slate-100 py-16 sm:py-20">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#b4232b]">Drain &amp; sewer work</p>
    <h2 class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-5xl">What A-1 Drain Cleaning clears</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">Most drain problems start with a restriction. The equipment and time needed depend on where the blockage is, what is in the pipe, access to the line, and what the pipe is doing.</p>

    <div class="mt-6 border-l-4 border-[#b4232b] bg-white p-5 sm:p-6">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Pricing is based on the actual job</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl leading-7 text-slate-700">A simple fixture clog and a blocked main sewer line are different jobs. A-1 discusses the current rate before work begins rather than publishing an outdated flat price that may not fit the blockage.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      {featured.map((service, index) => (
        <article class="group relative flex h-full flex-col border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg">
          <span class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-400">0{index + 1}</span>
          <h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950">
            <a href={`/services/${service.slug}/`}>{service.title}</a>
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 flex-1 leading-7 text-slate-600">{service.description}</p>
          <a href={`/services/${service.slug}/`} class="relative mt-5 inline-flex min-h-12 w-fit items-center font-black text-[#b4232b] underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4 hover:text-[#8f1b22]">Read service details →</a>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>

    <a href="/services/" class="mt-8 inline-flex min-h-12 items-center rounded-md bg-[#1A1A68] px-6 py-3 font-black text-white hover:bg-[#142052]">See all drain &amp; sewer services</a>
  </div>
</section>
